{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a medieval merchant and build the shop of your dreams. In <i>Village Merchant</i>, you\u2019ll buy, sell, and craft goods to satisfy the endless stream of peasants, nobles, and rogues crossing your threshold. Whether you\u2019re sharpening swords, polishing armor, or striking the perfect deal, each day brings new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Run your own medieval shop</strong> \u2013 Set prices, arrange your goods, and serve your customers. Manage your inventory and grow through trade routes that unlock new products and opportunities. From humble beginnings to becoming the most renowned merchant in the kingdom\u2014your decisions shape your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018170/extras/5d467cf307f65ac2162200d2a84988f2.poster.avif?t=1774015619\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018170/extras/5d467cf307f65ac2162200d2a84988f2.webm?t=1774015619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018170/extras/5d467cf307f65ac2162200d2a84988f2.mp4?t=1774015619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2692\ufe0f <strong>Unique minigames</strong> \u2013 Sharpen weapons, repair armor, and more. Customers are demanding\u2014maintain the quality of your items and don\u2019t let rust eat into your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018170/extras/3647a876878408a66e4b51f59c376e00.poster.avif?t=1774015619\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018170/extras/3647a876878408a66e4b51f59c376e00.webm?t=1774015619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018170/extras/3647a876878408a66e4b51f59c376e00.mp4?t=1774015619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc51 <strong>Diverse customers</strong> \u2013 From poor peasants to wealthy lords, each with their own needs. Maximize profits across every social class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018170/extras/61ddfdc325dcb05cf0dfcfd8deafc083.poster.avif?t=1774015619\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018170/extras/61ddfdc325dcb05cf0dfcfd8deafc083.webm?t=1774015619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018170/extras/61ddfdc325dcb05cf0dfcfd8deafc083.mp4?t=1774015619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Progression &amp; trade routes</strong> \u2013 Unlock rare goods and expand your empire. Every new product fuels the desire to grow your assortment even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018170/extras/1433a3c326c46a1f52724e3430626fe6.poster.avif?t=1774015619\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018170/extras/1433a3c326c46a1f52724e3430626fe6.webm?t=1774015619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/40181